/* ~~~~ CONTENT OF COLORS-LIGHT ~~~~~

ArcticWorks Design palette (light, derived per @arcticworks/design methodology):
  neutral ramp: 0 #FFFFFF · 50 #F2F2F4 · 100 #E8E8EB · 200 #D9D9DD · 300 #C4C4CA
                400 #A8A8B0 · 500 #8B8B93 · 550 #7A7A84 · 600 #6F6F78 · 700 #5A5A62
                750 #4E4E56 · 800 #3A3A42 · 850 #2C2C33 · 900 #1D1D22 · 925 #17171B · 950 #111114 · 975 #0B0B0D
  blue (interactive): 300 #8FBCFF · 400 #5C9CFF · 500 #3D8BFF · 550 #3D82F6 · 600 #2B6FD9 · 700 #245BC2
  status: success #3FB950 · warning #E3B341 · danger #F04A4A
See docs/ARCTICWORKS_THEME.md.

1.BASEMAP
2.BOUNDARY
3.NATURAL
  3.1 Main natural
  3.2 Vegetation
4.LANDUSE
  4.1 Main landuse
  4.2 Aerodrome
  4.3 Barriers
  4.4 Buildings
5.ROADS
  5.1 All roads
  5.2 Bridges
  5.3 Tunnels
  5.4 Piste
  5.5 Transport
 6.LABELS COLORS
  6.1 Main labels
  6.2 Natural labels
  6.3 Place labels
  6.4 Road labels
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
*/

